Subject: [PATCH 0/2] ARM: dts: sun5i: Add PocketBook 624

Add the PocketBook 624 (Basic Touch), an Allwinner A13 e-book reader
similar to the already supported PocketBook Touch Lux 3 and 614 Plus.

The e-ink panel is left out: it needs a dedicated EPD driver.

The touchscreen node uses touchscreen-inverted-x and
touchscreen-swapped-x-y; dtbs_check is clean only with the msg2638
binding fix "dt-bindings: input: touchscreen: msg2638: Allow common
touchscreen properties", sent to the input tree.

Wakeup from s2idle through the RTC and the keys also needs
"irqchip/sun4i: Allow interrupts to be used as wakeup sources", sent
separately.


